### 1. Acceptance of Terms

By accessing the website at **[sedssl.org](https://sedssl.org)**, submitting forms, participating in university chapters, or joining technical project divisions, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service and all applicable national laws and regulations.

If you do not agree with any of these terms, you are prohibited from using or accessing this site.

---

### 2. Organizational Mission & Membership

Students for the Exploration and Development of Space Sri Lanka (SEDS Sri Lanka) is an independent, non-profit student space organization dedicated to promoting aerospace engineering, satellite development, space robotics, astronomy, and STEM education.

- **Eligibility**: Student membership is open to all enrolled students in Sri Lankan universities, secondary schools, and general space enthusiasts.
- **Code of Conduct**: All active members must strictly adhere to the **[Code of Conduct](/code-of-conduct)** during all events, field tests, workshops, and team communications.
- **Revocation**: SEDS Sri Lanka reserves the right to suspend or terminate membership access for violation of safety protocols or community guidelines.

---

### 3. Safety & Experimental Projects

SEDS Sri Lanka organizes technical projects including CanSats, high-altitude weather balloons, rover prototypes, and rocketry study groups.

- **Safety Compliance**: All experimental test drops, radio transmissions, and propulsion tests must receive prior authorization and adhere to national aviation and telecommunications safety regulations.
- **Liability**: SEDS Sri Lanka will not be held liable for personal injury or property damage resulting from unauthorized experiments conducted without designated executive supervision.

---

### 4. Intellectual Property & Open Source

- **Educational Resources**: Club tutorials, open-source hardware designs, and research notes are published for educational use under standard open-access licenses unless otherwise specified.
- **Branding & Identity**: The SEDS Sri Lanka logo, mission insignias, domain name (`sedssl.org`), and official brand assets are protected and may not be used for unauthorized commercial endorsements.

---

### 5. Merchandise & Tally Orders

- **Community Support**: All proceeds from official merchandise sales (apparel, patches, stickers, and kits) directly fund student rocketry, rover development, and educational outreach.
- **Fulfillment**: Orders placed via our official Tally forms are verified manually. Delivery timelines across Sri Lanka typically take 3–7 business days following payment confirmation.

---

### 6. Modifications to Terms

SEDS Sri Lanka reserves the right to revise these Terms of Service at any time. By continuing to use the platform following updates, you agree to be bound by the current version of these terms.

---

